        "TileImage": "$($repository 8e39a621-8bbd-43b4-badc-3d6e73e43fd8).Image",
        "Description": "Agent &apos;Scarlet Russell&apos; is deployed deep within a secret society, She is tasked with taking out the ring leaders and sending a message.\r\rAgent Russell must eliminate the following 5 targets by slitting their throats and attaching a note to their corpses. If the mission escalates the agent is permitted to eliminate targets and opposing forces by any means necessary.\r\rHowever, we can not afford to leave any trace. Avoid eye witnesses and cameras at all costs.",
